cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Coordination Polymer & MOF Structure Lab"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based batch analysis of CIF files of metal–organic complexes,
  coordination polymers and metal–organic frameworks: network dimensionality
  and interpenetration, secondary building units, metal coordination geometry
  and distortion (continuous shape measures, bond-valence sums), ligand
  binding modes, hydrogen bonds, π–π stacking and porosity, with tables,
  figures, a 3D viewer and a Word report.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hafidzouihri-tech/cp-mof-structure-lab"
url: "https://hafidzouihri-tech.github.io/cp-mof-structure-lab/"
keywords:
  - crystallography
  - CIF
  - coordination polymers
  - metal–organic frameworks
  - continuous shape measures
  - bond valence
  - porosity
